# Repository ownership
#
# This project currently operates under a solo-maintainer ownership model.
# Keep source, tests, documentation, workflows, template configuration, release,
# and security/governance files owned by the repository maintainer until a
# broader maintainer group is intentionally documented.
#
# CODEOWNERS records ownership and review routing. While the bootstrap
# solo-maintainer governance posture applies, the canonical main-branch ruleset
# requires a pull request and release-blocking status checks but does not require
# self-approval, Code Owner approval, or last-push approval. Revisit those review
# requirements before removing the bootstrap exception or after a second active
# Core Maintainer is appointed.

